sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as Comprador
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as BFF Gateway
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant QW as Queue Worker
    participant OC as Offchain<br/>Consumer
    participant BC as Blockchain<br/>(Besu)
    participant EL as Event<br/>Listener

    Buyer->>FE: Seleciona propriedade para comprar<br/>(matriculaId: 12345)
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/request<br/>{matriculaId: 12345, buyerCpf: "12345678901"}
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/request<br/>+ JWT (authenticated as buyer)

    Orch->>Orch: Extract userId from JWT

    Orch->>DB: SELECT * FROM properties<br/>WHERE matricula_id = 12345
    DB-->>Orch: {id, proprietario (sellerId), status: OK, ...}

    Orch->>Orch: Validate:<br/>- Property exists<br/>- Status == OK<br/>- Buyer != Seller

    Orch->>DB: SELECT * FROM transfers<br/>WHERE matricula_id = 12345<br/>AND status NOT IN ('CONCLUIDA')
    DB-->>Orch: No active transfer

    Orch->>DB: SELECT * FROM users<br/>WHERE cpf = "12345678901"
    DB-->>Orch: Buyer {id, walletAddress: 0x1f5c...}

    Orch->>DB: INSERT INTO transfers<br/>(matricula_id, seller_id, buyer_id, status)<br/>VALUES (12345, sellerId, buyerId, 'PENDENTE')
    DB-->>Orch: Transfer ID created

    Orch->>MQ: Publish CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job<br/>{transferId, sellerAddress: 0x3b59...,<br/>buyerAddress: 0x1f5c..., matricula: 12345}

    Orch->>DB: UPDATE transfers<br/>SET status = 'CONFIGURANDO'<br/>WHERE id = transferId

    Orch-->>BFF: 201 Created<br/>{transferId, status: "CONFIGURANDO"}
    BFF-->>FE: Transfer initiated
    FE-->>Buyer: "Transferência em processamento.<br/>Aguardando configuração na blockchain..."

    Note over MQ,OC: === Processamento Assíncrono ===

    MQ-->>QW: Consume CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/request<br/>{from: "0x3b59...", to: "0x1f5c...", matricula: 12345}

    OC->>OC: Build transaction:<br/>requestPropertyTransfer(from, to, matricula)

    OC->>BC: Submit transaction to Besu
    BC-->>OC: Transaction Hash: 0xdef456...

    BC->>BC: Mine transaction

    BC->>BC: Validate:<br/>- propertyExists[matricula]<br/>- propertyOwner[matricula] == from<br/>- identityRegistry.isVerified(to)

    BC->>BC: Calculate requestHash:<br/>keccak256(from, to, matricula)

    BC->>BC: Store in pendingTransfers[requestHash]:<br/>{matricula, from, to, requester, requestedAt,<br/>exists: true, financialApproved: false,<br/>registryOfficeApproved: false,<br/>municipalityApproved: false,<br/>buyerAccepted: false, executed: false}

    BC->>BC: **Emit TransferRequested**<br/>{requestHash, matricula, from, to, requester}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected

    EL->>EL: Parse event:<br/>- event.args[0] = requestHash<br/>- event.args[1] = matricula<br/>- event.args[2] = from<br/>- event.args[3] = to<br/>- event.transactionHash

    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-requested<br/>{transferHash: requestHash, matriculaId: 12345,<br/>from: "0x3b59...", to: "0x1f5c...",<br/>transactionHash: "0xdef456..."}

    Orch->>DB: UPDATE transfers<br/>SET request_hash = ?,<br/>    blockchain_tx_hash = ?,<br/>    status = 'AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES'<br/>WHERE matricula_id = 12345
    DB-->>Orch: Updated

    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over Buyer,BC: **STATUS ATUAL:**<br/>- Transferência: AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES<br/>- request_hash: preenchido<br/>- blockchain_tx_hash: preenchido<br/>- Aguardando 3 aprovações + aceitação do comprador (parte 2)
